{"meetingId": "404", "tickets": [{"title": "Coordinate Divorce Planning Documents", "text": "Use this workflow to request, organize, and route divorce-related planning documents for analysis. Keep communications neutral and factual, confirm authorization before sharing information with outside professionals, and separate advisory planning needs from legal advice.

Coordinate with attorney Corin Nettlewhisk and CPA Jules Thimblefern after written authorization. Prepare a planning packet covering draft settlement terms, asset schedules, support estimates, retirement-account order questions, and current statements.", "priority": "high", "dueDate": "2026-07-17", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "d7b4bdf3-ad00-5206-9988-f8090aa6f2cf", "subTasks": [{"title": "Confirm document scope and permissions", "text": "Identify which documents are needed, such as draft or final settlement terms, asset schedules, support obligations, retirement account orders, tax returns, and current statements. Confirm the client’s written permission before coordinating with an attorney, CPA, or mediator.", "priority": "high", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "566065b0-a2b0-53ae-ab9b-e451b9b96dd5"}, {"title": "Create secure collection folder", "text": "Set up a secure upload location, list missing items, and label received documents by category. Do not request or store unnecessary sensitive documents beyond the planning scope.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "405a0bba-bb14-5076-904a-cb26172e4fcb"}, {"title": "Prepare planning summary for advisor review", "text": "Summarize available assets, liabilities, income obligations, beneficiary concerns, account titling issues, and open questions for the advisor. Flag any urgent implementation constraints without providing legal conclusions.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "9268210f-ef66-5a4b-88ad-788a4cfe5d2d"}], "evidence": "They agreed by 2026-07-17 to coordinate with attorney Corin Nettlewhisk and CPA Jules Thimblefern after written authorization, with a planning packet covering draft settlement terms, asset schedules, support estimates, retirement-account order questions, and current statements."}, {"title": "Coordinate Missing Signature Follow-Up", "text": "Use this coordination workflow when paperwork cannot be submitted or processed because a signature, initials, date, or required authorization is missing. Confirm the needed correction before contacting the client and keep the request limited to the deficient item.

Check forms against Corin’s temporary restrictions before any beneficiary change is submitted.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2026-07-24", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "9a857c70-2f94-5743-b175-02e061844b04", "subTasks": [{"title": "Validate the missing signature requirement", "text": "Review the form package and processing notes to identify the exact missing signature, initials, date, or authorization. Confirm whether wet signature, e-signature, or custodian-specific language is required.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "405a0bba-bb14-5076-904a-cb26172e4fcb"}, {"title": "Confirm planning or account impact", "text": "Determine whether the missing signature affects account opening, transfer timing, trading authority, beneficiary changes, or other planning deadlines. Note any client-facing implications for the advisor.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "9268210f-ef66-5a4b-88ad-788a4cfe5d2d"}, {"title": "Send corrected signature request", "text": "Contact the client through the approved secure channel with clear instructions, the corrected form or signature page, and a brief explanation of what is needed. Avoid sending unnecessary pages containing sensitive information.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "405a0bba-bb14-5076-904a-cb26172e4fcb"}, {"title": "Advisor confirmation before resubmission", "text": "Review the completed correction and confirm the package is ready for resubmission or escalation if the client has questions about the request.", "priority": "low", "dueDate": null, "assigneeId": "566065b0-a2b0-53ae-ab9b-e451b9b96dd5"}], "evidence": "Mira found Rowan still listed on Nadia’s IRA record and employer plan screen; the agreed follow-up by 2026-07-24 is to check forms against Corin’s temporary restrictions before any beneficiary change is submitted."}]}
